R(23,'P A Thomas','P A Thomas',T,'follows','court_own','Thus, the Supreme Court has clarified, in its decision in P A Thomas that the DOPPW OM dated 12 February 2009 was clarificatory in nature and would apply to cases which were pending on the date when the OM was issued.','high',N23)
