R(25,'Baljit Singh (supra)','Baljit Singh','(1996) 11 SCC 315','follows','court_own','The Supreme Court in the case of Baljit Singh (supra) also dealt with the contention that the employee was posted at a sensitive border area and, therefore, his illness was fully attributable to military service and negatived the same.','medium','Court later relies on respondent not being posted in sensitive border area (para 12).')
