R(30,'(2007) 1 SLR 616','Ex-Sepoy Gopal Singh Dadwal v. Union of India & Others','(2007) 1 SLR 616','follows','lower_forum','the High Court by a common order dated 30.4.2008 directed the respondents to hold the Appeal Medical Boasrd with further direction that the parameters laid down by the High Court in the cases of Ex-Sepoy Gopal Singh Dadwal v. Union of India & Others (2007) 1 SLR 616 and Ex-Cfn Sugna Ram Ranoliya v. Union of India & Others 132 (2006) DLT 544 (DB) be taken into consider\'.ltion.','medium','High Court (lower forum) directed its parameters to be applied. Headnote lists it as "referred to".')
